      <h1 class="ed-title">Best Treadmills With the Longest Warranty</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Almost every treadmill now advertises a “lifetime” warranty, and almost all of them mean the frame, the part least likely to fail. The terms that protect you are parts and labour. Here are seven treadmills ranked by those, with each maker’s own warranty checked on 21 November 2026.
      </p>

